  "problem": "Consider two sets of $16$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{16},$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{16}.$ You are given that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\sum }_{i=1}^{16}{x}_{i}=168, \\\\  & {\\sum }_{i=1}^{16}{y}_{i}=158, \\\\  & {\\sum }_{i=1}^{16}{x}_{i}{y}_{i}=1\\,742.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, ${S}_{xy}=$\n{{field-1}}.",
